{
  "info": {
    "name": "Mentor Management API — Full Test Suite",
    "description": "Tests all endpoints on Render: https://mentor-management-api.onrender.com\n\nHOW TO RUN:\n1. Import this file into Postman\n2. Set base_url to your API URL\n3. Run folders in order (Auth first, then rest)\n4. Variables auto-populate from responses",
